1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,448
Writing, task two. E-mail number 21: Swapping a shift.

2
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:15,258
You want to swap a shift with a colleague. Write him an e-mail. Write at least thirty-five words. Write one sentence for each picture.

3
00:00:24,100 --> 00:00:25,299
Hi Petr,

4
00:00:25,533 --> 00:00:27,490
can you swap a shift with me?

5
00:00:27,733 --> 00:00:30,892
I can't work on Saturday because my sister is getting married.

6
00:00:31,133 --> 00:00:33,351
It's Saturday, the 14th of June.

7
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:36,706
I can work for you on Sunday or next Monday.

8
00:00:36,967 --> 00:00:39,472
To say thank you, I'll buy you a coffee and cake.

9
00:00:39,733 --> 00:00:41,951
Please reply by Wednesday.

10
00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:49,486
This e-mail has 45 words. There is one sentence for each picture. Don't forget the greeting at the beginning and the end.

11
00:00:50,533 --> 00:00:58,890
Write your own e-mail on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website, the link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
